# Normalize all text files to LF in the index and check them out as LF on every
# platform. This overrides each developer's core.autocrlf, which on Windows
# defaults to `true` and would otherwise write CRLF into the worktree — and
# `oxfmt --check` (endOfLine: "lf", with no "auto" mode) rejects CRLF, so
# `bun run check` would fail after every checkout, merge abort, or branch switch.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.vsix binary
